1... d6 { That's the Pirc Defense. It's an hypermodern response where Black will apply pressure on the center from afar. } { [%cal Gf8g7,Gg7d4] } 2. d4 Nf6 { [%cal Gf6e4,Gf6d5] } 3. Nc3 { [%cal Gc3e4,Gc3d5] } 3... g6 4. Nf3 { That's the Classical Variation, developping our second Knight to control the center. } { [%cal Gf3e5,Gf3d4] } 4... Bg7 { Developping the Bishop in fianchetto, a usual hypermodern move. } { [%cal Gg7d4] } 5. Be2 { That's the Quiet System, just going for quick castlings on King side. } { [%cal Ge1g1,Ge8g8] } *


